 "remarks": "PRIME EAST NORWALK RETAIL LOCATION | HIGH VISIBILITY | READY FOR YOUR BUSINESS. Put your business in the heart of East Norwalk! This highly visible commercial space offers an exceptional location directly adjacent to the East Norwalk Metro-North train station parking lot, providing excellent exposure and convenient access. Ideal for a coffee shop, grab-and-go concept, delicatessen, restaurant delivery operation, specialty food business, or other retail use, subject to zoning and approvals. The flexible open floor plan includes a separate designated office space and is equipped with an existing commercial kitchen hood and grease trap offer a significant head start for restaurant, cafe, deli, or food-service operators-helping reduce build-out time and costs. An infrastructure to support a variety of business concepts, including: 400-amp electrical service, Central air conditioning, gas heating, 7' x 7' walk-in refrigerator, tile flooring throughout, open, adaptable layout, high-visibility location with strong foot traffic. Surrounded by luxury apartment communities, established neighborhoods, local businesses, marinas, and beaches, this location puts your business in front of both commuters and the growing East Norwalk residential community. Bring your business to East Norwalk and let the location work for you.",
